			"elType": "container",
			"settings": {
				"content_width": "full",
				"_css_classes": "section section-navy bt-landing-insight"
			},
			"elements": [
				{
					"id": "9c9fd82",
					"elType": "container",
					"settings": {
						"content_width": "full",
						"flex_direction": "column",
						"flex_gap": {
							"unit": "px",
							"size": 20,
							"column": "20",
							"row": "20",
							"isLinked": true
						},
						"_css_classes": "wrap"
					},
					"elements": [
						{
							"id": "1296625",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "heading",
							"settings": {
								"title": "Ken's note",
								"header_size": "p",
								"_css_classes": "eyebrow"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "633f72b",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>The mistake most people make with an adventure trip here is booking too much of it. Laos rewards the day you did not plan — the village you walk into at the wrong hour, the boatman who suggests a different landing.</p>\n<p>So we build in slack deliberately. If a trek is going well we keep going; if the river is high we change the plan that morning. That only works when the guide is local, licensed and knows who to call.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__body"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "ba20844",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>Ken FJ Her — founder, Brother Tours. Licensed Lao National Tour Guide since 2010; founded Brother Tours in 2018.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__attribution"
							},
							"elements": []
						}
					],
					"isInner": false
				}
			],
			"isInner": false
		},
		{
			"id": "492611d",
			"elType": "container",
			"settings": {
				"content_width": "full",
				"_css_classes": "section bt-landing-process"
			},
			"elements": [
				{
					"id": "3d05a55",
					"elType": "container",
					"settings": {
						"content_width": "full",
						"flex_direction": "column",
						"flex_gap": {
							"unit": "px",
							"size": 28,
							"column": "28",
							"row": "28",
							"isLinked": true
						},
						"_css_classes": "wrap"
					},
					"elements": [
						{
							"id": "36c0aaa",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "heading",
							"settings": {
								"title": "How Brother Tours plans it",
								"header_size": "p",
								"_css_classes": "eyebrow"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "0312d07",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "heading",
							"settings": {
								"title": "Five steps, one conversation",
								"header_size": "h2"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "bcc7731",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "html",
							"settings": {
								"html": "<ol class=\"bt-landing-steps\"><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">01</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Tell us about your trip</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Dates, pace, who is travelling, what you want the days to feel like.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">02</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Brother Tours designs the journey</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">A route built around your answers, not assembled from a package shelf.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">03</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Review and refine</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Change anything. Most journeys go through two or three rounds before they settle.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">04</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Human confirmation</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Every element is confirmed with the people who will actually deliver it.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">05</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Travel Laos</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Your guide, your driver, your itinerary — and someone reachable in Vientiane throughout.</span></li></ol>"
							},
							"elements": []
						}
					],
					"isInner": false
				}
			],
			"isInner": false
		},
		{
			"id": "583b0ea",
			"elType": "container",
